  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39499484",
      "title": "React Query Advantages In Action",
      "sourceHash": "de9ad1cc20c4cf791761b9d333378884d30848fafb0ac8cf00871589e1ad4e95",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.57,
          "end": 3.27,
          "en": "Now there's one other thing we can do",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.27,
          "end": 5.43,
          "en": "on this event details page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.43,
          "end": 9.03,
          "en": "We can also click this edit button to edit an event.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.03,
          "end": 12.93,
          "en": "And currently of course, this functionality is also missing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.93,
          "end": 16.86,
          "en": "Even though the button works, it does open this modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.86,
          "end": 20.34,
          "en": "But in there we can't really do anything.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.34,
          "end": 22.26,
          "en": "I mean, we can enter data here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.26,
          "end": 24.93,
          "en": "but if you click update, nothing happens.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.93,
          "end": 27.06,
          "en": "And of course it would also be nice",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.06,
          "end": 29.88,
          "en": "if this modal would be pre-populated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.88,
          "end": 32.97,
          "en": "with the event data to which it belongs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.97,
          "end": 36.03,
          "en": "So the event which we are trying to edit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36.03,
          "end": 38.55,
          "en": "And that's what we'll work on next.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 38.55,
          "end": 42.3,
          "en": "And for that we should switch to the EditEvent JSX file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 42.3,
          "end": 45.63,
          "en": "which is the component, as the name suggests,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 45.63,
          "end": 47.94,
          "en": "that is responsible for this modal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 47.94,
          "end": 50.643,
          "en": "and for managing this updating process.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 52.56,
          "end": 55.38,
          "en": "Now, in this component, as a first step",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 55.38,
          "end": 57.15,
          "en": "we should load the data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 57.15,
          "end": 60.9,
          "en": "that should be filled into this form as a default.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 60.9,
          "end": 63.93,
          "en": "And for that, my custom event form component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 63.93,
          "end": 66.39,
          "en": "which I'm providing as part of this project,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 66.39,
          "end": 68.91,
          "en": "actually has an input data prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 68.91,
          "end": 73.89,
          "en": "which can be used to pass an object with the default data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 73.89,
          "end": 77.10300000000001,
          "en": "for all these fields to this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 77.97,
          "end": 80.07,
          "en": "So we need to fetch this data now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 80.07,
          "end": 82.23,
          "en": "in order to pass it here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 82.23,
          "end": 85.47,
          "en": "And of course, fetching this data again means",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 85.47,
          "end": 89.34,
          "en": "that we should use useQuery from React Query,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 89.34,
          "end": 92.64,
          "en": "just as we did it before in this course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 92.64,
          "end": 96.03,
          "en": "So with that imported, here in this component function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 96.03,
          "end": 99.72,
          "en": "I'll execute it, pass this configuration object to it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 99.72,
          "end": 102.36,
          "en": "And here for this query function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 102.36,
          "end": 105.12,
          "en": "I want to use a function which I already have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 105.12,
          "end": 107.61,
          "en": "in my HTTP JS file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 107.61,
          "end": 109.38,
          "en": "This Fetch Event function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 109.38,
          "end": 112.25999999999999,
          "en": "because that will fetch us the event details",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 112.25999999999999,
          "end": 115.62299999999999,
          "en": "with which we want pre-populate this form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 116.78999999999999,
          "end": 119.34,
          "en": "Now this function needs the idea of the event,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 119.34,
          "end": 121.29,
          "en": "for which the data should be fetched",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 121.29,
          "end": 124.5,
          "en": "and an abort signal as an input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 124.5,
          "end": 128.4,
          "en": "And therefore, here in edit event for this Query function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 128.4,
          "end": 131.07,
          "en": "we should define an anonymous function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 131.07,
          "end": 133.56,
          "en": "where we automatically get an object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 133.56,
          "end": 137.313,
          "en": "that contains a signal property from React Query.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 138.32999999999998,
          "end": 141.39,
          "en": "And then here we should execute Fetch Event",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 141.39,
          "end": 145.593,
          "en": "which must be imported from the HTTP JS file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 147.48,
          "end": 150.39,
          "en": "And we then pass an object to Fetch Event",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 150.39,
          "end": 154.89,
          "en": "which contains this signal and also this ID",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 154.89,
          "end": 156.303,
          "en": "of this event here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 157.86,
          "end": 162.54,
          "en": "And to get this ID, we of course can and should use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 162.54,
          "end": 166.71,
          "en": "useParams from React Router DOM",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 166.71,
          "end": 168.903,
          "en": "to get this Params object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 169.98,
          "end": 173.793,
          "en": "because that then allows us to access params.id.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 175.59,
          "end": 179.01,
          "en": "Because in our route definition, if we take a look at that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 179.01,
          "end": 183.12,
          "en": "for the added page, we got this dynamic path segment",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 183.12,
          "end": 185.283,
          "en": "with an identifier of ID.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 187.14,
          "end": 190.14,
          "en": "So therefore, in this added event component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 190.14,
          "end": 193.65,
          "en": "this is how we can prepare our query function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 193.65,
          "end": 194.883,
          "en": "that should be executed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 195.84,
          "end": 198.28,
          "en": "Of course, I also want to have a query key",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 199.77,
          "end": 201.51,
          "en": "and here, that's events,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 201.51,
          "end": 204,
          "en": "and then again, params.id",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 204,
          "end": 207.75,
          "en": "because this query depends on the ID of the event",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 207.75,
          "end": 209.673,
          "en": "which we're trying to edit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 212.43,
          "end": 214.35,
          "en": "Well, and with that, as always,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 214.35,
          "end": 217.17000000000002,
          "en": "we'll get back an object with data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 217.17000000000002,
          "end": 220.59,
          "en": "The isPending property, the isError property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 220.59,
          "end": 223.35,
          "en": "and the error property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 223.35,
          "end": 226.713,
          "en": "And more properties which we don't need here though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 229.56,
          "end": 234.063,
          "en": "So now we can use data to pre-populate this form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 235.2,
          "end": 236.37,
          "en": "If we scroll down,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 236.37,
          "end": 239.97,
          "en": "we can therefore set input data equal to this data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 239.97,
          "end": 242.88,
          "en": "because I built this event form component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 242.88,
          "end": 246.42,
          "en": "as such that it exactly expects data in that shape",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 246.42,
          "end": 249.42,
          "en": "as we get it back from this backend.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 249.42,
          "end": 251.133,
          "en": "So this should just work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 252.12,
          "end": 254.07,
          "en": "But in addition, I of course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 254.07,
          "end": 257.07,
          "en": "also wanna show a loading indicator",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 257.07,
          "end": 259.83,
          "en": "if we're still waiting for a response,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 259.83,
          "end": 262.803,
          "en": "and an error block if we got an error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 264.57,
          "end": 266.07,
          "en": "Therefore, just as before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 266.07,
          "end": 268.23,
          "en": "I'll actually add a content variable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 268.23,
          "end": 270.933,
          "en": "and check if isPending is true.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 272.04,
          "end": 275.85,
          "en": "And if that's the case, if we are waiting for the response,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 275.85,
          "end": 280.56,
          "en": "I wanna output a div with a class name of center",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 280.56,
          "end": 282.69,
          "en": "for styling purposes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 282.69,
          "end": 285.72,
          "en": "And in there I want to have that loading indicator.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 285.72,
          "end": 289.17,
          "en": "And that loading indicator is simply a component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 289.17,
          "end": 291.573,
          "en": "you have to import from the UI folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 294.75,
          "end": 296.76,
          "en": "So that's the first step.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 296.76,
          "end": 299.64,
          "en": "As a next step, I'll check if we got an error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 299.64,
          "end": 304.05,
          "en": "just as we did it many times before in other components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 304.05,
          "end": 307.05,
          "en": "And if that's the case, content will be set",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 307.05,
          "end": 309.573,
          "en": "equal to a fragment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 310.41,
          "end": 314.64,
          "en": "where for one, I want to have this error block.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 314.64,
          "end": 317.49,
          "en": "But below that, then also a div,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 317.49,
          "end": 321.16,
          "en": "which has a class of form dash actions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 322.26,
          "end": 325.14,
          "en": "where I wanna provide a link",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 325.14,
          "end": 328.29,
          "en": "which is a component provided by React Router",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 328.29,
          "end": 330.99,
          "en": "which simply should allow me to leave this page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 330.99,
          "end": 333.03,
          "en": "and close this modal therefore,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 333.03,
          "end": 336.093,
          "en": "if we got an error fetching those events.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 337.29,
          "end": 339.09000000000003,
          "en": "So here I'll just say, okay,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 339.09000000000003,
          "end": 342.633,
          "en": "and give this link a class of button for styling purposes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 343.71,
          "end": 346.98,
          "en": "But then of course I also wanna show some error information.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 346.98,
          "end": 350.55,
          "en": "And therefore on this error block we can set a title",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 350.55,
          "end": 353.73,
          "en": "like Failed to load event.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 353.73,
          "end": 357.69,
          "en": "And then a message where as so often,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 357.69,
          "end": 361.23,
          "en": "we use that error object to output a message",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 361.23,
          "end": 362.97,
          "en": "or a hard-coded message",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 362.97,
          "end": 365.67,
          "en": "which could be Failed to load event.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 365.67,
          "end": 370.353,
          "en": "Please check your inputs and try again later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 375.93,
          "end": 377.61,
          "en": "So that's the content I want to have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 377.61,
          "end": 380.943,
          "en": "if we have an error fetching our event.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 381.84,
          "end": 385.53,
          "en": "Last but not least, if we have data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 385.53,
          "end": 389.43,
          "en": "I'll set content equal to this event form here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 389.43,
          "end": 391.983,
          "en": "because then I want to present this form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 393.3,
          "end": 395.15999999999997,
          "en": "And then, in the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 395.15999999999997,
          "end": 398.913,
          "en": "it's this content which should be output in this modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 401.28,
          "end": 404.44,
          "en": "So with that, if we save all of that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 406.89,
          "end": 408.33,
          "en": "and I reload this page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 408.33,
          "end": 410.31,
          "en": "we initially see the loading spinner",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 410.31,
          "end": 414.153,
          "en": "and then this form which is initialized with our data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 415.29,
          "end": 416.46,
          "en": "And if I, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 416.46,
          "end": 420.03,
          "en": "would try to load this page for an invalid ID.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 420.03,
          "end": 423.27,
          "en": "So if I manually added this ID in the URL,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 423.27,
          "end": 425.97,
          "en": "and for example, change it to ABC",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 425.97,
          "end": 428.85,
          "en": "which is an ID that does not exist here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 428.85,
          "end": 432.09,
          "en": "I get the loading spinner and it'll take a while",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 432.09,
          "end": 436.02,
          "en": "because React Query actually tries re fetching",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 436.02,
          "end": 437.28,
          "en": "if we got an error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 437.28,
          "end": 439.41,
          "en": "But then I got the error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 439.41,
          "end": 442.62,
          "en": "Also in the underlying event details page here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 442.62,
          "end": 444.54,
          "en": "but also here in our modal,",
